# ============================================================
#  Production build values (vite build).
#
#  Used by the Android app bundle, which has no dashboard to
#  read variables from - unlike Vercel, which supplies its own
#  and overrides everything here.
#
#  Nothing in this file is secret. Vite compiles VITE_* values
#  into the JavaScript that ships to the browser, so they are
#  public by definition. Real secrets live on Render only.
# ============================================================

